WHY THE AFFERO LICENCE
----------------------
This software's normal mode of use is as a network service: it publishes to a
Telegram channel, and its readers never receive a copy of it. Under a plain GPL
that use would carry no obligation at all, because nothing is distributed.

AGPL section 13 closes that. Anyone who runs a modified version of this bot,
for any audience, must offer that audience the modified source. Running it is
the trigger, not shipping it.


